class_name FontGlyphs
extends RefCounted

## A chunky 6x7 font with 2-pixel strokes, in the spirit of Game Boy text.
## Each glyph sits in the top-left of an 8x8 cell; "#" is ink.
## Lowercase text is drawn with the uppercase glyphs.

